  "name": "Excalidraw",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Generate architecture diagrams as Excalidraw files from natural language",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 agent** and **1 command**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `excalidraw` (Generates Excalidraw architecture diagrams from natural language)\n- **Agents** (1): `diagram-from-code` (Analyzes a codebase to automatically generate an architecture diagram)\n- **Commands** (1): `draw` (Generate an architecture diagram as an Excalidraw file from a natural language description)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install excalidraw@claude-community` from `yogsma/excalidraw-plugin`.",
